<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh retail cuts not tested; sknd. hams 17-20 lbs. $1.00 lower, 20-26 lbs. steady; sdls. bellies steady to $1.00 higher for immediate ship; lean trimmings $1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Trading very slow, with light to moderate demand and</p>
<p>offerings. -USDA</p>
